---
title: The ultimate AeroPress by James Hoffmann
source: https://aeroprecipe.com/recipes/james-hoffmann-aeropress-recipe
filter: paper
---

@AeroPress 11g 200g 99°C -- no rinse, no preheat
grind medium-fine

0:00 200g -- wet all the coffee, then set the plunger 1 cm in to stop the drip
2:00 /swirl -- gently, holding the brewer and the plunger
2:30 /press ~30s -- gently, all the way

target 3:20
